This project uses System.Data.SQLite.Core (https://system.data.sqlite.org/).
Its source code is dedicated to the public domain:
https://system.data.sqlite.org/index.html/doc/trunk/www/copyright.wiki

The Microsoft Public License covers only the "SQL Generation" code of System.Data.SQLite.Linq and
System.Data.SQLite.EF6, which this project does not use.

SQLite itself is in the public domain.
For more information, visit: https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html

The published binaries of version 1.0.119 are also built with the SQLite Encryption Extension (SEE) of
Hipp, Wyrick & Company, Inc. (https://sqlite.org/see), which is not public domain and needs its own license
to be used. This project does not use it. The Windows native library includes zlib
(https://zlib.net/zlib_license.html).
